Error: Username (-u) is required

Usage: scrc [options]

Options:
  -h <host>      Server hostname or IP (default: localhost)
  -p <port>      Server port (default: 8080)
  -u <user>      Username (required)
  -c <catalog>   Catalog name
  -f <file>      Read queries from file instead of stdin
  --help         Show this help

If no file is specified, runs in interactive mode.
In interactive mode, type 'exit' or 'quit' to quit.
Queries can be multiline, end with ';'.
exit: 1
